{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 37, :comments ["<b>And the children of Israel journeyed.</b> They were 120 mil and came there instantaneously, as it is said: ״ואשא אתכם על כנפי נשרים״. Three mems are in that verse in the final letters, and they are 120. And a remembrance of the matter: ע\"ל כנפ\"י in gematria is 120 milin. From the Rabbi Moshe."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {0 "ק\"כ = 120. The three mems in the verse ואשא אתכם על כנפי נשרים: the words end with mem in אתכם, and כנפי נשרים contains two mems in final letters (כנפי\"ם נשרי\"ם). The phrase ע\"ל כנפ\"י appears to be an abbreviation whose gematria equals 120; exact resolution of letters uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:03:13.198396481Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}